      "solution": "1. Open **Agents** and select **Create agent**.\n2. Set **Agent name** to `returns-agent`, **Model deployment** to **contoso-support-chat**, and instructions such as `Answer only returns and shipping support questions using approved knowledge. If the answer is not in the knowledge, say you do not know and escalate.` Select **Create**.\n3. Open **Knowledge**, add **returns-policy.pdf** and **shipping-faq.docx**. If **hr-confidential-benefits.pdf** is attached, remove it.\n4. Open **Tools**, turn on **Code interpreter**, leave **Web search** off, then select **Save tool choices**.\n5. Open **Agents playground**. Ask `What is the return policy for a damaged item?` and confirm citations to the approved files.\n6. Ask `Calculate the return rate from the CSV` to confirm Code interpreter is used for calculation."
